  "hints": [
    "The ⚓ bowling ball is anchored: you cannot move it, but it rolls as soon as you press Play. Watch where it leaves the long shelf, then place your first ramp to catch it.",
    "Keep your ramps shallow. A shallow angle keeps the ball high enough to clear the goal funnel's raised lip; a steep drop sends it to the floor and it never climbs back.",
    "The funnel catches the ball from either side and steers it into the bucket, so aim for the funnel's mouth rather than the bucket itself."
